title: 'to Doc: the nearest thing to skg before skg was federated wiki, and a stranger who knew it will ask how skg avoids its "catch-up problem".'
pid: 79b04f3b-2d6d-4070-b6b7-8b6d4c7bfb48
body: |2-
  Tay suggested the digital garden and Xanadu as the way in for a
  stranger. Federated wiki is closer: one follows and answers another's
  pages by forking them. Its users found that whole-page copies drift
  apart; skg's fork copies one layer and shares the rest. Both are in
  [[id:0d49b634-b190-48b0-8656-c99f824d19c0][Federated wiki followed by forking for a decade before skg, and what its users met says what to build and what to leave alone.]]
